# FR-4.7, retired

Retirement is carried by this file's name. The row is kept so the id stays registered as retired and can never be reused.

| ID | Retired | Superseded by |
|---|---|---|
| FR-4.7 | 2026-09-07 | nothing. TOML no longer ships, per FR-2.7. |

It stated TOML's canonical form and what that form refuses. There is no TOML
codec in any pack now, so there is nothing for the row to be true of, and it was
the only requirement in the set with no test in any suite the moment the codecs
went.
